"Enable the file system extension" = "启用文件系统扩展";
"Open System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › File System Extensions and turn on Ext4Kit." = "打开「系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 文件系统扩展」，然后打开 Ext4Kit。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Connect an ext4 disk" = "连接 ext4 磁盘";
"Disks formatted with ext4, ext3 or ext2 are mounted automatically once the extension is enabled." = "启用扩展后，ext4、ext3、ext2 格式的磁盘会自动挂载。";
"Mount manually (optional)" = "手动挂载（可选）";
"To mount a partition or a disk image yourself, run in Terminal:" = "如需自行挂载分区或磁盘镜像，请在终端中运行：";
"Read and write Linux ext4 disks on your Mac" = "在 Mac 上读写 Linux ext4 磁盘";
"Version %@" = "版本 %@";
"Changes are journaled: an interrupted write never corrupts the file system." = "所有修改都写入日志：写入过程被中断也不会损坏文件系统。";
"Always eject the disk before unplugging it." = "拔出磁盘前请先推出。";
"Encrypted folders stay locked until their key or passphrase is added under Encrypted disks; they can still be deleted." = "加密文件夹在“加密磁盘”中添加对应的密钥或口令之前保持锁定，但仍可以删除。";
"Casefolded or compressed ext4 volumes are mounted read-only." = "启用大小写不敏感或压缩的 ext4 卷以只读方式挂载。";
"For LUKS-encrypted disks and fscrypt-encrypted folders. When such a disk is connected, Ext4Kit tries these passphrases and key files, then remembers the key of that disk in your keychain." = "用于 LUKS 加密的磁盘和 fscrypt 加密的文件夹。连接这类磁盘时，Ext4Kit 会依次尝试这里的口令和密钥文件，成功后把该磁盘的密钥保存到你的钥匙串中。";
"Passphrase" = "口令";
"Add" = "添加";
"Add Key File…" = "添加密钥文件…";
"Nothing saved yet." = "尚未保存任何内容。";
"Encrypted disks" = "加密磁盘";
"Could not update the keychain" = "无法更新钥匙串";
"OK" = "好";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Key file “%@”" = "密钥文件“%@”";
"LUKS disk" = "LUKS 磁盘";
"LUKS disk “%@”" = "LUKS 磁盘“%@”";
"Encrypted folders" = "加密文件夹";
"Encrypted folders on “%@”" = "“%@”上的加密文件夹";
"Tried on encrypted disks without a remembered key" = "用于尚未保存密钥的加密磁盘";
"Remembered key" = "已保存的密钥";
"Saved. Connect the disk now; if it is already connected, eject it and connect it again. The first unlock of a LUKS disk can take several seconds." = "已保存。现在连接磁盘；如果磁盘已经连接，请先推出再重新连接。LUKS 磁盘第一次解锁可能需要几秒钟。";
"Choose a key file (a LUKS key file, or an fscrypt key)." = "选择密钥文件（LUKS 密钥文件或 fscrypt 密钥）。";
"A key file must hold between 1 byte and 8 MiB." = "密钥文件的大小必须在 1 字节到 8 MiB 之间。";
"Good to know" = "注意事项";
"Copy" = "拷贝";
